OL,4,CGB win decider to reach Davis Cup semi-
OL,5,Cfinals                                 
OL,6,GGreat Britain advanced to the semi-    
OL,7,Gfinals of the Davis Cup for the first  
OL,8,Gtime since 2019 as Henry Patten and    
OL,9,GNeal Skupski won a decisive doubles    
OL,10,Gtie against third seeds Germany in     
OL,11,GBologna.                               
OL,13,FPatten and Skupski, playing together   
OL,14,Ffor the first time since announcing    
OL,15,Ftheir doubles partnership for the 2027 
OL,16,Fseason, proved too clinical for Kevin  
OL,17,FKrawietz and Tim Puetz.                
OL,19,FThey converted two break points and    
OL,20,Fsaved five in the first set, before    
OL,21,Foverturning a mini-break in the tie-   
OL,22,Fbreak to win 6-2 7-6 (8-6).            
